SecChat is a purpose-built Node.js + PostgreSQL application with a Flutter client — the suite's
auditable team-chat and agentic-chat surface. It deploys a PostgreSQL (https://www.postgresql.org)
container for durable storage, authenticates users through SecSSO via OpenID Connect, routes
governed model calls through SecRouter, and drives coding agents with the pi agent runtime. Each
of those is a separate project under its own license, integrated at run time rather than included
in this repository — PostgreSQL's container image is pulled at deploy time.
